  <h1>You're with a client.<br /><em>The phone shouldn't win.</em></h1>
  <p>An AI receptionist that answers while your hands are busy and your next client is already in the chair — handling the pricing and gift-card questions, filling cancellations, and nudging people to rebook, without ever quoting a service it can't see.</p>
