      <h2 class="lcard-title">Hands in someone's hair</h2>
      <p>A colour service runs two hours and a massage runs ninety minutes. You physically cannot take that call, and stepping out to answer it costs you the client in the chair.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lcard">
